çApokaluptike satira tes sugkhrones Amerikes. O Maikl Mour kataggellei me kaustiko khioumor tis anoikhtes pleges tes khoras: ton analphabetismo, ton ratsismo, ten eleuthere oplophoria, te thanatike poine, ten oikonomike exathliose megalon stromaton tou plethusmou, ta diaplekomena sumpheronta kai ten alazonike kai aneuthune exoterike politike tes kuberneses Mpous. (Apo ten parousiase tes ekdoses)"î
ëE Maria Poludoure protou aphosiothei oloklerotika sten poiese, eikhe askholethei me ton pezo logo kai malista me ten apaitetike phorma tou muthistorematos. To "Romantso" tes, pou egrapse to 1926 kai proteine gia ekdose ston Kh. Ganiare, sunista ena proimo deigma neoterikes strophes tou ellenikou muthistorematos, toso gia ten prototupe aphegematike tekhnike pou egkainiazei, oso kai gia tis monternes idees pou diatuponontai stis selides tou.
Ektos apo to "Romantso" tes Poludoure, sten parousa ekdose sugkentronontai ola ta euriskomena peza tes: selides emerologiou, mia autobiographia, duo mikra lurika aphegemata, keimena epistolikes logotekhnias, alla kai anekdota grammata tes apo to Parisi, pou dinoun semantikes plerophories gia tis sunthekes diamones tes, alla kai gia ten tukhe tou muthistorematos tes.
Genikotera, ta keimena autou tou tomou, pou epimeleitai e Khristina Ntounia, pistopoioun ten aphegematike ikanoteta, ten oxumene koinonike euaisthesia, alla kai ten upsele autosuneidesia tes Poludoure os gunaikas kai demiourgou."£
